WEBVTT

00:12:28.494 --> 00:12:31.413
to achieve and create the future we want

00:12:31.413 --> 00:12:34.792
and not overreact
to a future that we fear.

00:12:35.626 --> 00:12:36.794
Thank you.

00:12:36.835 --> 00:12:40.631
(Applause)

00:12:40.672 --> 00:12:42.424
Chris Anderson: Please stay.

00:12:42.424 --> 00:12:45.928
I think this is so interesting.

00:12:45.969 --> 00:12:50.390
It seems to me, at the heart
of what you're wrestling with each time

00:12:50.432 --> 00:12:52.726
is this, you know, it's a moral question.

00:12:52.768 --> 00:12:57.022
So most moral philosophers, I think,
would say that fundamentally,

00:12:57.064 --> 00:12:59.983
there's not a difference
between intentional action